<p>Jab karbala se lut ke watan ko haram phire<br>
Garebaa'n siyaah posh basad ranj o gham phire<br>
Ek dusre se kehte huwe ye baham phire<br>
Yu lout kar na aaye koi jaise ham phire</p>

<p>Hujrou me sab to ashkou se daaman bhigoti hai<br>
Lekin rabab sehan hi me baithi roti hai</p>

<p>Jab baithe baithe dhoop me arsa guzar gaya<br>
Haalat qarab hogayi chehre ka rang udhaa<br>
Zainab ne ek din aake bade dard se kaha<br>
Hujre me chaliye bhaabi ye hai hukm imaam ka</p>

<p>Saaye me ab bahaal kuch ousaan keejiye<br>
Yu dhoop me naa jaan ko halkaan keejiye</p>

<p>Jab sab ba zid huwe to ye kehne lagi rabaab<br>
Waada kiya hai ru baroo e ibne buturaab<br>
Saaye me ab naa baithungi aye aasmaa'n janaab<br>
Kis dil se laau waada qilaafi ki ab mai taab</p>

<p>Kya ye sunu mai fatima ke noor e ain se<br>
Waada wafa na kar saki baano hussain se</p>

<p>Jab dhoop se uthi na rabaab e jigar figaar<br>
Samjha ke le chale unhe sajjad e naamdaar<br>
Muh kar ke karbala ki taraf royi zaar zaar<br>
Boli ke waada aap se tha hu mai sharmsaar</p>

<p>Majboor kar diya mujhe hukm e imaam ne<br>
Rakh leeje aabru meri in sab ke saamne</p>

<p>Ye kehte kehte hichki lagi dam nikal <br>
gaya<br>
Sajjad bole amma ne waada wafa kiya<br>
Zainab ne roke sibte payambar ko di sada<br>
Aasaan kar de meri bhi mushkil pa'e quda</p>

<p> Mere bulaane me bhi na taaqeer ab karo<br>
Akbar ka waasta mujhe jaldi talab karo</p>

<p>Zainab ki is fughaa'n pe qayamat ka tha samaa'n<br>
Thi bibiyaa'n Rabaab ki qismat pe nouha qaa'n<br>
Aur sar jhukaaye baithe the sajjad e natawa'n <br>
Aayi sada e sayyada kaanou me naagahaa'n</p>

<p>Marqad me apni aaj ye soyegi chain se<br>
Mai sadqe isne qoob nibaahi hussain se</p>